%% Policy-governed AI agents — publication-safe logical architecture
%% This separates model-assisted interpretation from deterministic operational control.
flowchart LR
    U[User interaction] --> L[LLM interpretation]
    L --> C[Context and entity resolution]
    C --> S[Explicit workflow state]
    S --> P[Policy / confirmation boundary]
    P --> X[Authorized execution]
    X --> V[Verified result]
    V --> R[Supported response or escalation]

    classDef controlled fill:#272A2A,stroke:#B8A58C,color:#ECE5D7
    classDef reasoning fill:#2B211D,stroke:#D67B56,color:#ECE5D7
    classDef state fill:#182A31,stroke:#7FA7B4,color:#ECE5D7
    classDef outcome fill:#263A39,stroke:#7FA7B4,color:#ECE5D7

    class U controlled
    class L reasoning
    class C,S state
    class P,X reasoning
    class V,R outcome
